A start. Let's start with Watson. He was listed as questionable all the way until about 45 minutes before tipoff. Chris Fedor of Cleveland.com reported that he is in fact out. Later, Cleveland.com's Ethan Sands relayed that Thomas will start. Along with Watson, Jaylon Tyson is out, as is big man&hellip;", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreicdyczcscfxqdygqfcec3jxof6qaohn5nopw42s6mqhxsaf5gnhbi"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 97846}, "title": "Peyton Watson out for Cavs; Meleek Thomas to\u00a0start", "uri": "https://hoopswire.com/peyton-watson-cavs-meleek-thomas-nba/"}}, "text": "Peyton Watson out for Cavs; Meleek Thomas to start"}, "embed": {"external": {"uri": "https://hoopswire.com/peyton-watson-cavs-meleek-thomas-nba/", "title": "Peyton Watson out for Cavs; Meleek Thomas to\u00a0start", "description": "CLEVELAND -- It's a case of bad news, but not terrible news, for the Cavaliers in their home game against the Thunder on Monday. The bad news? Peyton Watson is out with hamstring soreness. The not-terrible news? Rookie Meleek Thomas will receive his first NBA start. Let's start with Watson. He was listed as questionable all the way until about 45 minutes before tipoff. Chris Fedor of Cleveland.com reported that he is in fact out. Later, Cleveland.com's Ethan Sands relayed that Thomas will start. Along with Watson, Jaylon Tyson is out, as is big man&hellip;", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:lit6brtzcvv26tk7lrbx5bf6/bafkreicdyczcscfxqdygqfcec3jxof6qaohn5nopw42s6mqhxsaf5gnhbi"}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 1, "likeCount": 4, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-02T23:30:58.487Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:t5sokllv34muqolbjhguabvo/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzei5u5vix2n", "cid": "bafyreich2jedqz7ztqvzqaii6qgupzmawe66dxuaieqoexghur7q23nbfy", "author": {"did": "did:plc:t5sokllv34muqolbjhguabvo", "handle": "thepaulieprops.bsky.social", "displayName":